# Judge10-16-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,ArmR5,ArmL5,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Cry_Open01,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Closed01,Angle01/Head/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"反正就算出去了，<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_16_01\">也不会有任何改变</link>。|#0205Trial16_AnAn001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,ArmR5,ArmL11,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Cry_Open02,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Uncomfortable_Open,Angle01/Head/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:你们也一样吧！<br>仅仅因为能使用魔法<br>就曾遭受过<br>压迫和歧视！|#0205Trial16_AnAn002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Cry_Open02,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Uncomfortable_Open,Angle01/Head/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"明明只是比别人<br>稍微<link=\"Objection_02_05_16_02\">优秀</link>一点而已，<br>为什么我们就<br>必须受到迫害！|#0205Trial16_AnAn003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Cry_Closed,Angle01/Head/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"既然如此，<br>在那些愚蠢家伙的目光<br>看不到的监狱里待着<br>反而会<link=\"Objection_02_05_16_03\">更好</link>，不是吗？|#0205Trial16_AnAn004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Yell_Open,Angle01/Head/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"对外面的留恋<br>只不过是被<link=\"Objection_02_05_16_04\">过去</link>束缚之人的<br>妄言罢了！|#0205Trial16_AnAn005|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

