@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"只要<link=\"Objection_02_05_16_05\">忘掉</link>一切就好！<br>没必要<link=\"Objection_02_05_16_06\">看</link>外面的世界！<br>吾辈就在这里！|#0205Trial16_AnAn006|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

